{"id": "508", "title": "亮剑", "author": "都梁", "category": "文学名著", "count": 47, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/0/508.htm", "intro": "在浩浩的历史长河中，有那么一个将军，他就像那只传说中的荆棘鸟，歌唱着死去。在那荆棘刺进的一瞬，他没有意识到死之将临，只是放开那可媲美夜莺的歌喉，直到生命之终点，但是，当他扑向那棘刺时，他是知道的，他是明明白白的，然而，他却依然要这样做，依然把棘刺扎进胸膛。不！他并没有死，涅槃后的那只荆棘鸟终修得正果，成为中华民族永恒的火凤凰！", "base": "files/article/html/0/508", "chapters": [{"title": "亮剑 上", "file": "80195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "亮剑 中", "file": "80196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "亮剑 下", "file": "80197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "80198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "80199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "80200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "80201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "80202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "80203.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "80204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "80205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "80206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "80207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "80208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "80209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "80210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "80211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "80212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "80213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "80214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "80215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "80216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "80217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "80218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "80219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "80220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "